  "_comment": "Shared by tests/test_notification_policy.py (rules.conversation_channel_enabled) and, with the cadrage's T19 ticket, the frontend notificationPolicy.ts suite. Each case: rules, a conversation and a channel in, one boolean out. `now` is epoch seconds for the global pause; when null the pause is not evaluated. Optional `mention` (the question is about the message.mention notification of a CHAN message) and `cloud` (the channel is a third party) default to false; a mention reaches the channels of events[\"message.mention\"] and those with a stored true exception.",
